title Class structure — Share profiles publicly (later phase)

class DeviceProfile {
  +formatVersion: number
  +identity: DeviceIdentity
  +protocol: string
  +readableMetrics: ReadableMetric[]
  +controllableFeatures: ControllableFeature[]
  +verdict: Verdict
  +locationLabel?: string
}

abstract class InvestigationStore <<contract>> {
  +listProfiles(): Promise<DeviceProfile[]>
}

class ExportService {
  +estimate(id: string): Promise<ExportSizes>
  +export(request: ExportRequest): Promise<ExportResult>
}

class ExportResult {
  +fileName: string
  +bytes: number
}

abstract class ProfileSharingService <<contract, not built>> {
  +share(profile: DeviceProfile): Promise<ShareResult>
}

note right of ProfileSharingService
  Not written until OQ-03 and OQ-05 are answered.
  Fields shared, redaction, consent and origin: <TO SUPPLY>
end note

ExportService --> InvestigationStore : reads
ExportService ..> DeviceProfile : serialises
ExportService ..> ExportResult : returns
ProfileSharingService ..> DeviceProfile : would share
@enduml
